@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Create a shipment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "ABC Exports",
  "origin": "Chennai",
  "destination": "Dubai"
}

### 2. List shipments (optional filter: ?status=Booked)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments

### 3. Move shipment forward (Booked -> InTransit -> Delivered)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InTransit"
}

### 4. Create an invoice for shipment 1 (18% tax)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipmentId": 1,
  "currency": "INR",
  "taxRate": 18,
  "lines": [
    { "description": "Ocean freight", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 45000 },
    { "description": "Terminal handling charges", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 3500.50 }
  ]
}

### 5. Get invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/1

### 6. List invoices (filters: ?status=Draft&shipmentId=1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices?status=Draft

### 7. Issue invoice (Draft -> Issued)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/1/issue

### 8. Mark invoice paid (Issued -> Paid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/1/pay

### 9. Try an invalid request (shows validation errors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipmentId": 0,
  "taxRate": 150,
  "lines": []
}

### 10. Try an invalid status change (returns 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/1/issue
